\par\par \b \uc2 Boeing\uc2 , Union Chiefs Agree on New Pact With Striking Workers\b0\par\par\uc2 By Sharon Terlep \par \uc2 274 \uc2 words\par \uc2 1 November 2024\par \uc2 The Wall Street Journal\par \uc2 J\par B1\par \uc2 English\par \uc2 Copyright 2024 Dow Jones & Company, Inc. All Rights Reserved. \par \par \uc2 Boeing\uc2  has reached a deal with leaders of its machinists union, trying for a third time to end a strike that has halted most of its airplane production.\par \par \uc2 The strike, which began on Sept. 13, has hobbled \uc2 Boeing\uc2 's business, costing the company an estimated $1 billion a month. Chief Executive \uc2 Kelly Ortberg\uc2  has set plans to cut 17,000 jobs while raising more than $24 billion in equity to keep the company afloat.\par \par \uc2 The company is offering a 38% wage increase over four years in its latest proposal. That is up from its original offer of 25%, which was overwhelmingly rejected by a union local representing machinists in the Pacific Northwest who build most of \uc2 Boeing\uc2 's jets.\par \par \uc2 The company and union announced the deal Thursday.\par \par \uc2 The union plans to vote on the deal Monday. Nearly 95% of workers voted to reject the first tentative deal, which the union's leaders had recommended. About 64% of workers rejected a second offer that included a 35% wage increase over four years and other improvements from the first deal.\par \par \uc2 The latest offer doesn't restore pensions, which was a key demand of many members but something union leaders had said might be out of reach. \uc2 Boeing\uc2  would increase company 401(k) contributions under the new deal.\par \par \uc2 The company also would keep paying annual bonuses, which were eliminated as part of the initial offer, and pay $12,000 ratification bonuses.\par \par \uc2 The previous offer included a $7,000 ratification bonus and a $5,000 401(k) contribution, which isn't part of the latest deal.\par \par \uc2 Document J000000020241101ekb10001w\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw300\pich40\picscaley125\picscalex125\picwgoal3600\pichgoal480
